go-msx-penguin

This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project. It is not affiliated
with, authorised by or endorsed by the rights holder of the original game.

This repository contains only original source code. It does not contain
or distribute the original ROM image, nor any graphics, sound, text or
other data taken from it. Users must supply their own legally obtained
copy of the ROM; the tools here extract the data the engine needs from it
locally, at build time.

The engine is a native reimplementation written in Go. It does not
execute, emulate or include any of the original program code.

All trademarks and copyrights in the original game belong to their
respective owners. If you are a rights holder and have concerns about this
project, please open an issue or contact the maintainer and it will be
addressed promptly.
